1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:03,251
Jesus got into a boat, crossed over, and came to His own town.

2
00:00:03,947 --> 00:00:06,757
Just then some men brought to Him a paralytic lying on a mat.

3
00:00:07,036 --> 00:00:11,843
When Jesus saw their faith, He said to the paralytic, “Take courage, son; your sins are forgiven.”

